{"id":"dlp\/v2\/listdlpjobsrequest","type":"","title":"Google\\Cloud\\Dlp\\V2\\ListDlpJobsRequest","name":"ListDlpJobsRequest","description":"<p>The request message for listing DLP jobs.<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[],"methods":[{"id":"__construct","type":"constructor","name":"__construct","source":"Dlp\/src\/V2\/ListDlpJobsRequest.php#L167","description":"<p>Constructor.<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[{"name":"data","description":"<p>Optional. Data for populating the Message object.<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null},{"name":"data.parent\n","description":"<p>Required. Parent resource name. The format of this value varies depending on whether you have <a href=\"https:\/\/cloud.google.com\/dlp\/docs\/specifying-location\">specified a processing location<\/a>: + Projects scope, location specified:<br\/> <code>projects\/<\/code><var>PROJECT_ID<\/var><code>\/locations\/<\/code><var>LOCATION_ID<\/var> + Projects scope, no location specified (defaults to global):<br\/> <code>projects\/<\/code><var>PROJECT_ID<\/var> The following example <code>parent<\/code> string specifies a parent project with the identifier <code>example-project<\/code>, and specifies the <code>europe-west3<\/code> location for processing data: parent=projects\/example-project\/locations\/europe-west3<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.string.php\" target=\"_blank\">string<\/a>"],"optional":null,"nullable":null},{"name":"data.filter\n","description":"<p>Allows filtering. Supported syntax: <em> Filter expressions are made up of one or more restrictions. <\/em> Restrictions can be combined by <code>AND<\/code> or <code>OR<\/code> logical operators. A sequence of restrictions implicitly uses <code>AND<\/code>. <em> A restriction has the form of <code>{field} {operator} {value}<\/code>. <\/em> Supported fields\/values for inspect jobs: - <code>state<\/code> - PENDING|RUNNING|CANCELED|FINISHED|FAILED - <code>inspected_storage<\/code> - DATASTORE|CLOUD_STORAGE|BIGQUERY - <code>trigger_name<\/code> - The resource name of the trigger that created job. - 'end_time<code>- Corresponds to time the job finished. - 'start_time<\/code> - Corresponds to time the job finished. <em> Supported fields for risk analysis jobs: - <code>state<\/code> - RUNNING|CANCELED|FINISHED|FAILED - 'end_time<code>- Corresponds to time the job finished. - 'start_time<\/code> - Corresponds to time the job finished. <\/em> The operator must be <code>=<\/code> or <code>!=<\/code>. Examples: <em> inspected_storage = cloud_storage AND state = done <\/em> inspected_storage = cloud_storage OR inspected_storage = bigquery <em> inspected_storage = cloud_storage AND (state = done OR state = canceled) <\/em> end_time &gt; \\&quot;2017-12-12T00:00:00+00:00\\&quot; The length of this field should be no more than 500 characters.<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.string.php\" target=\"_blank\">string<\/a>"],"optional":null,"nullable":null},{"name":"data.page_size\n","description":"<p>The standard list page size.<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.integer.php\" target=\"_blank\">int<\/a>"],"optional":null,"nullable":null},{"name":"data.page_token\n","description":"<p>The standard list page token.<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.string.php\" target=\"_blank\">string<\/a>"],"optional":null,"nullable":null},{"name":"data.type\n","description":"<p>The type of job. Defaults to <code>DlpJobType.INSPECT<\/code><\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.integer.php\" target=\"_blank\">int<\/a>"],"optional":null,"nullable":null},{"name":"data.order_by\n","description":"<p>Comma separated list of fields to order by, followed by <code>asc<\/code> or <code>desc<\/code> postfix. This list is case-insensitive, default sorting order is ascending, redundant space characters are insignificant. Example: <code>name asc, end_time asc, create_time desc<\/code> Supported fields are: - <code>create_time<\/code>: corresponds to time the job was created. - <code>end_time<\/code>: corresponds to time the job ended. - <code>name<\/code>: corresponds to job's name. - <code>state<\/code>: corresponds to <code>state<\/code><\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.string.php\" target=\"_blank\">string<\/a>"],"optional":null,"nullable":null},{"name":"data.location_id\n","description":"<p>Deprecated. This field has no effect.<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.string.php\" target=\"_blank\">string<\/a>"],"optional":null,"nullable":null}],"exceptions":[],"returns":[]},{"id":"getParent","type":"instance","name":"getParent","source":"Dlp\/src\/V2\/ListDlpJobsRequest.php#L189","description":"<p>Required. Parent resource name.<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[],"exceptions":[],"returns":[{"types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.string.php\" target=\"_blank\">string<\/a>"],"description":""}]},{"id":"setParent","type":"instance","name":"setParent","source":"Dlp\/src\/V2\/ListDlpJobsRequest.php#L212","description":"<p>Required. Parent resource name.<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[{"name":"var","description":"","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.string.php\" target=\"_blank\">string<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null}],"exceptions":[],"returns":[{"types":["<a data-custom-type=\"cloud-dlp\/master\/dlp\/v2\/listdlpjobsrequest\">Google\\Cloud\\Dlp\\V2\\ListDlpJobsRequest<\/a>"],"description":""}]},{"id":"getFilter","type":"instance","name":"getFilter","source":"Dlp\/src\/V2\/ListDlpJobsRequest.php#L248","description":"<p>Allows filtering.<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[],"exceptions":[],"returns":[{"types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/langua